## [Unreleased]

### Added

- Initial Supabase deployment rendered from the [`supabase-docker`](../supabase-docker/) copier template.
- 7-service Docker Compose stack: PostgreSQL 15 + pgvector, PostgREST, GoTrue, Realtime, Studio, Meta, Caddy.
- OpenTofu infrastructure (DigitalOcean droplet, reserved IP, firewall, monitoring alerts) with DO Spaces remote state (SSE-C encrypted).
- Ansible playbooks (common/docker/supabase roles) for post-provision app-layer configuration.
- Bootstrap-secret rotation (Layer 2) — cloud-init mints v2 Infisical Machine Identity secret and revokes v1 within minutes of provisioning.
- Pop schema migration (`001_pop_schema.sql`) — pop schema + tenants registry + 6 tables + 24 RLS policies + `set_tenant_from_jwt()` PostgREST hook + `pop_admin` bypassrls role.
- `generate-secrets.sh` helper — mints all 10 Supabase app secrets including HS256-signed `ANON_KEY` and `SERVICE_ROLE_KEY` JWTs.
- Backup/restore scripts with GFS retention (daily 30, monthly 12, yearly forever) — pg_dumpall + volume tars → DO Spaces.

### Security

- Bootstrap-secret rotation invalidates the v1 Machine Identity secret within minutes of provisioning
- All app secrets fetched at runtime from Infisical (ADR-006 in-container injection) — none on disk
- TLS via Caddy + Let's Encrypt (auto-renewed)
- `.infisical-auth.env` written with 0600 permissions (root-only)
- SSH firewall restricted via `ssh_source_cidrs` variable
- Docker daemon config: log rotation + overlay2 storage driver

